# JSON Buddy - AI-Powered JSON Formatter & Cleaner

## Project Overview
This is a React TypeScript application that provides an AI-powered JSON formatter, validator, and cleaner. The app allows users to format JSON, convert between JSON and Python formats, and use AI assistance for fixing malformed JSON.

## Key Features
- **Real-time JSON formatting and validation**
- **AI-powered JSON fixing** using Google Gemini AI
- **Multiple output formats**: JSON and Python dictionary
- **Interactive JSON structure collapsing**
- **File upload/download capabilities**
- **Copy to clipboard functionality**
- **Statistics and analytics tracking**

## Tech Stack
- **Frontend**: React 18 + TypeScript
- **Build Tool**: Vite
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS
- **AI Integration**: Google Gemini AI via [api/gemini-ai.js](mdc:api/gemini-ai.js)
- **Animations**: Framer Motion
- **Deployment**: Vercel

## Main Entry Points
- [App.tsx](mdc:App.tsx) - Main application component containing the core logic
- [index.tsx](mdc:index.tsx) - Application entry point
- [index.html](mdc:index.html) - HTML template
- [vite.config.ts](mdc:vite.config.ts) - Build configuration

## Core Architecture
The application follows a component-based architecture with custom hooks for business logic:
- **Components**: Reusable UI components in [components/](mdc:components/)
- **Hooks**: Custom React hooks for state management in [hooks/](mdc:hooks/)
- **Utilities**: Helper functions in [lib/](mdc:lib/)
- **Constants**: Shared constants and icons in [constants.tsx](mdc:constants.tsx)
